    {
      "id": "scale",
      "title": "Fetch what you need",
      "accent": "#563d72",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "h2",
          "text": "SCALE / 07"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Large transcripts should not make every clone enormous."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Blobless fetches bring down trees and commits. Pruned checkpoints keep a useful working set; older values can be fetched on demand."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The README reports about 500 MB of compressed transcript data versus less than 2 MB for its blobless example."
        }
      ],
