          "text": "WHAT COMES NEXT / 08"
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Public, corporate and personal metadata can use separate destinations."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "The reference implementation exercises the format. Higher-level tools handle display, automatic capture, rebasing and synchronization."
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "Designed for integration into GitButler, with broader interest from Jujutsu and Git."
        }
